internal_name: PS_MAGE1
name: Hero: Sorcerer: Beyond the Hall of Heroes lies the Chamber of Bone. Eternal d...
text: Beyond the Hall of Heroes lies the Chamber of Bone. Eternal death awaits any who would seek to steal the treasure secured within this room. So speaks the Lord of Terror. And so it is written.

internal_name: PS_MAGE2
name: Hero: Sorcerer: Let this tome serve as your warning. This is a forbidden plac...
text: Let this tome serve as your warning. This is a forbidden place. Return from whence you came, and your life will be spared. Horazon, master of the disciplines that summon and bind creatures to this plane, promises death to those who pass beyond the Five Pillars. You have been admonished.

internal_name: PS_MAGE3
name: Hero: Sorcerer: Then, by binding the spirit to the crafted rock, it is given...
text: Then, by binding the spirit to the crafted rock, it is given life. This sounds like a spell of some kind.

internal_name: PS_MAGE4
name: Hero: Sorcerer: The Creature of Flame by Horazon. Hmm. Should be interesting...
text: The Creature of Flame by Horazon. Hmm. Should be interesting reading.

internal_name: PS_MAGE5
name: Hero: Sorcerer: Morta, Vespa, Gaia, Innúmino, Evigin, Jatan, Lua, Gretan.
text: Morta, Vespa, Gaia, Innúmino, Evigin, Jatan, Lua, Gretan.

internal_name: PS_MAGE6
name: Hero: Sorcerer: The lieutenant of Belial is known as Grimspike. Beware this d...
text: The lieutenant of Belial is known as Grimspike. Beware this demon, for his strength appears immeasurable. Reading this scroll, and therefore speaking his name, near an arcane circle of binding will surely summon him there. Hmm. Near a circle of binding, eh?

internal_name: PS_MAGE7
name: Hero: Sorcerer: This looks like some sort of journal. It seems that I may hav...
text: This looks like some sort of journal. It seems that I may have brought something into this plane that even I cannot control. The creature that fell into my astral trap is a very deadly demon. I have been able to bind it at the bottom of a pit, but it kills everything that I have sent there in attempts to defeat it. While it cannot escape, it does block the tunnels that lead to my protected haven. I don't know if it will just leave, but I fear it is smarter than most of the lesser demons I have trapped before. If I could just lure it somewhere else.

internal_name: PS_MAGE8
name: Hero: Sorcerer: Your death will be avenged!
text: Your death will be avenged!

internal_name: PS_MAGE9
name: Hero: Sorcerer: Rest in peace, my friend.
text: Rest in peace, my friend.

internal_name: PS_MAGE10
name: Hero: Sorcerer: And so, locked beyond the gateway of blood and past the Hall...
text: And so, locked beyond the gateway of blood and past the Hall of Fire, valor awaits for the Hero of Light to awaken.

internal_name: PS_MAGE11
name: Hero: Sorcerer: I can see what you see not. Vision milky, then eyes rot. When...
text: I can see what you see not. Vision milky, then eyes rot. When you turn, they will be gone, whispering their hidden song. Then you see what cannot be. Shadows move where light should be. Out of darkness, out of mind. Cast down into the halls of the blind.

internal_name: PS_MAGE12
name: Hero: Sorcerer: The armories of hell are home to the Warlord of Blood. In his...
text: The armories of hell are home to the Warlord of Blood. In his wake lay the mutilated bodies of thousands. Angels and men alike have been cut down to fulfill his endless sacrifices to the Dark Ones, who scream for one thing. Blood.

